-- Queer Atlas venue intelligence: global review-led editorial pass, batch 39.
-- Eight Bogota records, individually researched and rewritten.
-- Diosa, Disco Jaguar and El Coq are inclusive or mixed spaces, not verified dedicated LGBTQ+ venues.
-- Checked 2026-08-06. Source names remain in evidence metadata, not reader-facing topic copy.

