with reviewed(id, patch) as (
  values
    (1200::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This men-only spa is built for a long visit, not a nightclub dash. Thursday can be lively without feeling jammed; regulars describe roughly four-hour stays. Arrive before the late-afternoon swell for first choice of lockers and facilities. Entry is 18+, and you may need your own underwear and soap.',
      'best_nights', 'Thursday has the clearest social pulse, with a drag or stripper show reported alongside a full, mixed-age house. Any afternoon works for the Roman pool, salt jacuzzi, steam and sauna; choose earlier hours for calm, later for cruising. It closes at 9pm, so this is a warm-up rather than an afterparty.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay and bi men across age groups make up the room, with Bogotanos at the core and travellers drawn by its long history. Bodies and levels of undress vary: one regular counted a near-even split between underwear and nude. It is explicitly men-only, so it is not a broad all-genders queer venue.',
      'dress_code', 'There is no fashion test after check-in. Underwear, towel or nudity are the practical modes, depending on the zone and your comfort. Bring clean underwear, flip-flops and personal toiletries because supplies and signage have disappointed some guests. Consent matters more than confidence in the cruising areas.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Recent reviewers repeatedly praise the clean facilities and friendly, knowledgeable team; the small gay-history collection gives the place unusual character. Criticism focuses on unclear wayfinding, cold showers and a play layout some find underwhelming. Accessibility details are not published clearly.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_men_only_gay_spa_with_long_bogota_history_pool_jacuzzis_sauna_steam_cruising_show_programming_and_strong_cleanliness_service_consensus',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://complicesspa.com/quienes-somos/','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/6023902/c%C3%B3mplices-spa','https://www.top-rated.online/cities/Bogota/place/p/13156985/C%C3%B3mplices%2BSPA','https://www.thegayagenda.fyi/bogota/businesses/complices-spa/','https://linktr.ee/ComplicesSpa']::text[]),
