    (589::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This is a neighbourhood-scale gay bar, so the pressure point is usually the bar rather than a velvet-rope queue. Thursday starts gently; Friday and Saturday build after dinner and can tighten toward midnight. Published hours currently end at 3am. Ask the price before ordering, as recent guests flag costly beer.',
      'best_nights', 'Friday and Saturday give the fullest dance-bar energy; Thursday is better when you want room to talk. The appeal is straightforward music, drinks and local company rather than a giant production. Check the live page first, because regulars say the offer has changed and attendance has softened.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay men and queer Chapinero regulars lead, with friends and travellers folding into a mostly local room. It feels less like a destination megaclub and more like a familiar stop on the neighbourhood circuit. The crowd can be thinner than older accounts suggest, especially when prices or programming miss the mood.',
      'dress_code', 'Casual night-out clothes work: fitted tee, jeans, sneakers or a brighter party look. No reliable formal code is published, and the venue is praised more for ventilation and an easy atmosphere than door theatre. Dress for dancing until 3am and keep valuables close when moving through Chapinero late.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Many guests describe friendly service, pleasant music and a comfortable setup. The weaker signal is commercial: newer reviews question steep beer prices and changed offerings, while an older complaint alleges dishonest service. Confirm prices aloud, keep the receipt and raise any mismatch before leaving the bar.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_chapinero_gay_neighbourhood_dance_bar_with_thursday_to_saturday_hours_local_regular_energy_good_ventilation_and_material_price_value_concerns',
      'identity_note', 'Current directory evidence places Coyote Crazy at Carrera 9 #59-09; the stored record has no street address and needs location verification before routing.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.thegayagenda.fyi/bogota/businesses/coyote-crazy/','https://es.restaurantguru.com/Coyote-Crazy-Disco-Dance-Bogota']::text[]),
