    (592::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'Because the sauna and hostel run around the clock, there is rarely one nightclub-style arrival line. Early morning is repeatedly described as surprisingly busy; quieter periods vary. At peak times, the real wait may be for a locker or a favoured wet area. Confirm the day rate before entering the hostel-sauna complex.',
      'best_nights', 'This is one place where “best night” misses the point: recent visitors find energy after midnight and into early morning. Go then for the strongest social and cruising pulse; choose daytime for a calmer circuit through the sauna, steam and whirlpool. Twenty-four-hour access is the defining advantage.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay and bi men form the core, mixing Bogotanos, hostel travellers and international visitors across ages and body types. The overnight rhythm is more transient than a neighbourhood bar. English-speaking guests report no language barrier, but this remains a men-focused sauna, not an all-genders space.',
      'dress_code', 'Street clothes end at the locker; towel, swimwear or nudity depends on the zone and your comfort. Bring flip-flops and basic toiletries, stay hydrated and keep consent explicit in dark or cruising areas. There is no fashion door, but hostel guests should separate valuables and room keys from wet-area belongings.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Current 2026 reviews praise clean, working facilities and a professional, attentive team; guests say limited Spanish was manageable. That outweighs older mixed ratings. Detailed mobility access, trans inclusion and written consent procedures were not found, so verify specific needs directly.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_twenty_four_hour_men_focused_gay_sauna_and_hostel_with_overnight_early_morning_energy_diverse_traveller_mix_and_strong_current_cleanliness_service_reviews',
      'identity_note', 'Current directory evidence places Dagoas at Calle 59 #9-34; the stored record has no street address and should be verified before directions are shown.',
