    (1194::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'A popular Friday or Saturday can mean a cover queue and congestion between rooms. Four hours is a common full visit, so arrive before midnight to explore before the floors compress. Thursday listings vary; older safety complaints make it wise to confirm the cover and payment method at entry.',
      'best_nights', 'Friday and Saturday deliver the complete multi-room sweep: salsa and merengue beside electronic, reggaetón, soul, disco and funk. Pick Thursday only after confirming it is active. Go for a Colombian crossover night with options, not a guaranteed queer programme; the room can change personality with each DJ.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Bogotanos over 30 are repeatedly visible, joined by younger groups, dancers and international visitors. The club appears in LGBTQ+ city guides, but the working crowd is mixed rather than queer-majority. Locals outnumber destination tourists on ordinary weekends; familiar Colombian rhythms are the social glue.',
      'dress_code', 'Smart-casual party clothes fit the polished multi-room setting, but no dependable written code was found. Wear shoes that can move from salsa to electronic floors and keep a secure layer for the journey home. A neat look is prudent; do not mistake inclusion in a queer guide for a no-discretion door.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Many guests enjoy the musical range and lively local atmosphere. The review record also contains serious complaints about security, dismissive staff, cover handling and card disputes, alongside newer criticism of the DJ mix. Confirm every charge, protect your drink and seek help early if something feels wrong.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_mixed_multiroom_bogota_crossover_club_included_in_lgbtq_guides_with_local_over_thirty_strength_but_no_verified_queer_majority_and_material_service_safety_complaints',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://wanderlog.com/place/details/978671/disco-jaguar','https://es.restaurantguru.com/Disco-Jaguar-Bogota','https://www.idt.gov.co/sites/default/files/Guia-LGBTI-Digital.pdf','https://revistadc.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MAPA-BOGOTA-FEBRERO-web.pdf','https://www.travelgay.com/bogota-gay-bars']::text[]),
