    (1673::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'The door can be the whole story. A named DJ night draws a line, and entry is often cash; recent guests report expensive cover, list disputes and selective refusals. Arrive early with the event details saved, confirm cover before joining, and carry a backup plan. Inside, the compact room and terrace fill quickly.',
      'best_nights', 'Wednesday’s electronic series is the clearest recurring anchor; Thursday can have sharper local energy, while weekends depend on the DJ. Go for eclectic house and electronic curation, not generic crossover. Check the lineup: a strong selector is what turns this small room into a destination.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Style-conscious Zona T locals, electronic regulars, creative groups and visiting DJ followers lead the floor. Queer guests are part of the mix, but current evidence does not establish an LGBTQ+-majority room. It can feel socially polished and insider-led, with list culture creating a sharper local-outsider divide.',
      'dress_code', 'A considered look helps: dark clubwear, tailored casual, interesting texture or clean minimal pieces fit the vintage-industrial room. No clear written code exists, yet a 2025 guest reports rejection framed around clothing. Treat the door as discretionary, avoid beachwear and keep another electronic option ready.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Praise centres on the DJs, atmosphere and some warm Thursday staff. Counter-signals are substantial: reports of elitist admission, dress-based discrimination, poor ventilation, self-service at high prices and a card overcharge later reversed. Pay cash only with a clear price, or check the terminal before approving.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_zona_t_electronic_house_club_with_stylish_local_insider_crowd_cash_entry_and_material_door_discrimination_payment_ventilation_and_value_concerns_not_verified_lgbtq_majority',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://wanderlog.com/es/place/details/1826714/el-coq','https://co.iqos.com/es/noticias/vida-nocturna-bogota-el-coq-bogota','https://www.idt.gov.co/sites/default/files/4.2%20Gu%C3%ADa%20LGBTI%20Espa%C3%B1ol.pdf','https://observatorio.desarrolloeconomico.gov.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/cuaderno40.pdf','https://www.instagram.com/elcoqcoq/']::text[]),
